est]\n- What I need are the ffs: \n  1) Instrumental ver. (MR or AKA BGM)\n  2) MR with Topliner/Topline (BGM with guide melody line for the vocal)\n\n- The keyword would be (Kawaii) Future bass / Groovy / Electro-pop / Cute / A bit of Guitar included (OC plays a guitar) / reminiscent of the Night of the Universe and stars / a little mature and sophisticated\n\n[Useage]\n- I am going to create videos about my OC, and post them on Twitter and a personal blog of mine for my self-satisfaction.\n- I need to upload it to YOUTUBE for blogging (for traffic reduction),\nBut it will be non-commercial, and of course, I will insert your nickname as a composer in the video and description section of every post.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1q3pm0jJcA3DzXd6J5fXsFIL5409rXXdm?usp=drive_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@BeatzChiva/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "music", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1643127, "client_id": 2008635, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1619714140393844736%2FoAfsdGVe.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61c637caff0077c09d325f6946aaec49", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1619714140393844736%2FoAfsdGVe.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61c637caff0077c09d325f6946aaec49, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1619714140393844736%2FoAfsdGVe.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dcf69d0b9f918634e33187f038677841 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1619714140393844736%2FoAfsdGVe.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0382bfcd6a02ec5b259