s of science, and often makes technology! Also, they play piano, an expert!\nTheir background is harsh, with evil people raising them... but Gibby escapes, swearing to help the world and improve lives! A kind soul\n\nI'm asking for is a combat song. Where someone badly hurt their friend, and they use all that intelligence to take them down, his backstory making him violent! It is very threatening, and with a lot of technology. A fast paced combat!\n\nHints of their nice self scattered in the music at points? Maybe some piano?\nBut truly, do what you think fits best, and sounds good to you!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/24562168.gibby/gallery", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@BeatzChiva/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "music", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1643127, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1619714140393844736%2FoAfsdGVe.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61c637caff0077c09d325f6946aaec49", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1619714140393844736%2FoAfsdGVe.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61c637caff0077c09d325f6946aaec49, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1619714140393844736%2FoAfsdGVe.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dcf69d0b9f918634e33187f038677841 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1619714140393844736%2FoAfsdGVe.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0382bfcd6a02ec5b2594e4be9534eb8b 3x"}, "preview_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/fd2f8b44-7a9e-4123-863b-b8696b1d03d2?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1783796018&Signature=A9mG3uML